sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Player
    participant Server
    participant Timer
    participant Bot as "Gpt-5.1-chat"
    participant GameGroup as "WS Group: game_{id}_all"

    Note left of Player: after night and check <br> win end
    Server ->>+ GameGroup: notify_game_phase(discussion)
    GameGroup -->>- Player: WS Event: discussion

    Server ->> Server: create discussion poll
    Server ->>+ GameGroup: notify_poll_begin(poll)
    GameGroup -->>- Player: WS Event: poll
    Server ->> Timer: start (300s)

    loop for each player
        Player ->> Player: discuss and vote
        Player ->> Server: vote
    end

    alt  All votes received in time
        Server ->> Timer: cancel
    else Timeout
        Timer -->> Server: timeout
    end

    Server ->> Server: compute_result(poll)
    Server ->>+ Bot: generate lynch report
    Bot -->>- Server: lynch_report
    Server ->>+ GameGroup: notify_narrator_story(lynch_report)
    GameGroup -->>- Player: WS Event: lynch_report
    Server ->> Timer: start (30s)
